6.26 evening analysis
 DIF and DEA both run in sync below the zero line, and the short-term market is entirely dominated by the bears;
MACD green bearish energy histogram continues to expand, and the downward momentum has not shown any signs of exhaustion or dulling;
After the two lines form a dead cross and diverge downward, even if a rebound appears, it is only a weak corrective repair and is difficult to directly reverse the downward structure. Without strong support from the news backdrop, any rebound is essentially an opportunity for everyone to play counter-trend shorts.
My personal suggestion: go short directly around 60500–61200. If it breaks through, add to the short with a target of 58500–58000. If it breaks down further, then we need to watch 55000. #BTC #ETH #BTC走势分析
